<para>File: <filename>window.ui</filename> (For use with gtkmm 3, not gtkmm 2)
</para>
<programlisting>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;
&lt;interface&gt;
  &lt;!-- interface-requires gtk+ 3.8 --&gt;
